# Welcome to {{ cfg.site_name }}

This is the place to look when you're preparing a session or wondering what you have to play with. It covers the game systems, modules and worlds on our Foundry servers, and it updates itself every night.

## Where to start

- **[Game Systems](systems/index.md)**: the rules our tables run on and what each one offers a GM.
- **[Modules](modules/index.md)**: what each add-on does and how to use it at the table, grouped by topic.
- **Worlds**: our campaigns and which modules each one uses. {{ env_links | mdjoin(" · ") }}

Looking for something specific? The search box at the top finds any module, system or world by name or by what it does.

## Good to know

Summaries are written by AI from each module's own documentation, so they can get details wrong. If something doesn't match what you see in Foundry, trust Foundry and follow the repository link on the module's page.

Nothing here can be edited by hand, and there's no need to: install a module or enable it in a world, and it shows up here the next day. New modules show *Summary pending* until their summary is ready.

Curious what changed recently? See [Changes](changes.md).
